# Bước 1: tạo project Next.js
```
mkdir -p ~/nextjs-jetson
cd ~/nextjs-jetson
```

Tạo package.json:
```
nano package.json
```

```
{
  "name": "nextjs-jetson",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev -H 0.0.0.0",
    "build": "next build",
    "start": "next start -H 0.0.0.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "next": "15.5.2",
    "react": "19.1.1",
    "react-dom": "19.1.1"
  }
}
```

### Bước 2: tạo trang Next.js
```
mkdir -p app
nano app/page.js
```

```
export default function Home() {
  return (
    <main style={{ padding: "40px", fontFamily: "Arial" }}>
      <h1>Next.js trên Jetson</h1>
      <p>Docker đang chạy thành công.</p>
    </main>
  );
}
```

### Tạo layout:
```
nano app/layout.js
```

```
export const metadata = {
  title: "Jetson Next.js",
};

export default function RootLayout({ children }) {
  return (
    <html lang="vi">
      <body>{children}</body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

Bước 3: tạo Dockerfile
```
nano Dockerfile
```

```
FROM node:22-bookworm-slim

WORKDIR /app

COPY package*.json ./

RUN npm install

COPY . .

RUN npm run build

EXPOSE 3000

CMD ["npm", "run", "start"]
```

### Bước 4: tạo .dockerignore
```
nano .dockerignore
```

```
node_modules
.next
npm-debug.log
.git
```

## Bước 5: build Docker image
```
sudo docker build -t nextjs-jetson .
```

```
cd ~/nextjs-jetson
sudo docker build -t nextjs-jetson .
```

```
sudo docker run -d \
  --name nextjs-jetson \
  --restart unless-stopped \
  -p 80:3000 \
  nextjs-jetson
```

```
sudo docker ps
```


Bạn cần thấy dạng:
```
0.0.0.0:80->3000/tcp
```

Test ngay trên Jetson:
```
curl http://localhost
```

Nếu Jetson có firewall:
```
sudo ufw allow 80/tcp
sudo ufw status
```

